{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42617","headline":"题甘露寺 · 杨夔","name":"题甘露寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高殿拂云霓，登临想虎溪。\n风匀帆影衆，烟乱鸟行迷。\n北倚波涛阔，南窥井邑低。\n满城尘漠漠，隔岸草萋萋。\n虚阁延秋磐，澄江响暮鼙。\n客心还惜去，新月挂楼西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}